#!/usr/bin/with-contenv bashio
# The run script's loop should never exit on its own — this only fires if
# it crashed. s6 restarts the service automatically after this script
# returns; all this does is make that visible in the add-on's log.
EXIT_CODE="${1:-0}"
bashio::log.warning "HA SOC Probe exited with code ${EXIT_CODE} — restarting."
